				<<elseif $worn.neck.name is "love locket" and [$loveInterest.primary, $loveInterest.secondary, $loveInterest.tertiary].includes($worn.neck.photo) and !$NPCList.find(npc => npc.fullDescription === $worn.neck.photo) and !_rubbedNecklace>>
					당신은 로켓을 손에 쥔 채
